# @nxgt/* is published to the public npm registry, so nothing here is needed to
# *install* them — this file exists only so `bun publish` / `changeset publish`
# reach npmjs with a token. Reading requires no authentication at all, which is
# the whole reason this scope is not on GitHub Packages: that registry demands a
# token even for public packages, and it would have to be threaded through every
# CI job and Docker build in both monorepos.
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
